    "intro_html":  "Gnocchi simmered in a creamy tomato sauce with browned turkey, then blanketed in melted mozzarella. This is the rich one: 795 calories with \u003cstrong\u003e42 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.75 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The gnocchi cooks right in the sauce, so all that starch thickens dinner instead of going down the drain.",
